{"about_the_game":"<strong>Explore 4 vast, scenic landscapes with audio-reactive elements inspired by the music of MYRNE's EP &quot;Circles&quot;.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Can I Do:</h2>Set amongst red sands, this world is littered with runes and artefacts of a once-powerful society. Undiscovered constellations and celestial bodies move across the sky above you as you explore, illuminating new secrets to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Circles:</h2>A spelunking adventure within a vast, mystical cave. Unlock and interact with the mysteries of the Circles as you make your way through an ancient cave system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotion:</h2>Set in a verdant, lush plateau, explore the remnants of a lost tribe as they try to tell you their stories through flickering artefacts. Relax in a stoic experience atop the cliffs; but stay away from the edges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faithless:</h2>A dense, forested jungle is littered with bioluminescent flora, surrounding a mystic river. Cliffs and otherworldly plants keep vantage points well-hidden. Daylight cycles are extremely short, so plan your explorations wisely.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1984070?t=1652857608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1652857608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1652857608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1652857608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Explore 4 vast, scenic landscapes with audio-reactive elements inspired by the music of MYRNE's EP &quot;Circles&quot;.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Can I Do:</h2>Set amongst red sands, this world is littered with runes and artefacts of a once-powerful society. Undiscovered constellations and celestial bodies move across the sky above you as you explore, illuminating new secrets to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Circles:</h2>A spelunking adventure within a vast, mystical cave. Unlock and interact with the mysteries of the Circles as you make your way through an ancient cave system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotion:</h2>Set in a verdant, lush plateau, explore the remnants of a lost tribe as they try to tell you their stories through flickering artefacts. Relax in a stoic experience atop the cliffs; but stay away from the edges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faithless:</h2>A dense, forested jungle is littered with bioluminescent flora, surrounding a mystic river. Cliffs and otherworldly plants keep vantage points well-hidden. Daylight cycles are extremely short, so plan your explorations wisely.","developers":["Metamo Industries"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984070/header.jpg?t=1652857608","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1984070/459363/76c049542c90f289201ccfd2bedbd6744143a002/1751064117/dash_av1.mpd?t=1651803724","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1984070/459363/76c049542c90f289201ccfd2bedbd6744143a002/1751064117/dash_h264.mpd?t=1651803724","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1984070/459363/76c049542c90f289201ccfd2bedbd6744143a002/1751064117/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1651803724","id":256884594,"name":"MYRNEscapes Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256884594/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1651803724"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1984070/460721/99f32be5c0e8cb09189dc7cf3f0b4815ebdb091d/1751064119/dash_av1.mpd?t=1651803730","dash_h264":"https:/